      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "**Bug Report Title: Checkout Page Failure in Mobile App**\n\n**Description:**\nThe 'Checkout' button in the mobile application fails to initiate the expected process. Despite multiple attempts upon clicking (5 clicks), the screen remains unchanged, although a brief loading spinner appears momentarily.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n1. Launch the application on a mobile device.\n2. Navigate to the cart/checkout page.\n3. Click on the 'Checkout' button.\n4. Observe the repeated attempts with no change in screen but a passing loading spinner.\n\n**Expected Behavior:**\nUpon clicking the 'Checkout' button, the user should be guided to complete the checkout process.\n\n**Actual Behavior:**\nNo change in screen, a temporary loading spinner that disappears, and the inability to proceed to checkout. No errors or messages are displayed.\n\n**Environment:**\nReported on both Chrome and Safari on mobile devices.\nVerified login functionality in above environment.\n\n**Potential Cause:**\nPossible timeout issue or API unavailability. However, no definitive error message or affected APIs identified.\n\n**Severity:**\nThis issue significantly hinders the checkout process, directly affecting user experience and potentially resulting in loss of sales. Urgent attention required to resolve. \n\n**Attachments:**\n- Screenshots",
